{"unit_id":"GooodWei__context-vista#card-zh","repo":"GooodWei/context-vista","commit":"c57a4954639c63ccac2744d6c66ec2a67dd5b892","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"context-vista（DSH 网页插件）：在对话区展示当前上下文用量与费用。它注册 /context 斜杠命令，并在右侧常驻可拖动、可收起的实时悬浮卡。主要功能包括用环形图拆分系统、工具、消息和剩余容量，显示预计请求占用，汇总会话及子代理 token，按模型和峰谷价格估算费用，并可触发上下文压缩或归档清空当前计费。适合希望在 DeepSeek Harness 网页会话中观察上下文容量和费用的用户。无需额外账号或密钥，可自定义路由、模型价格、货币及时区。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:898-1020","lib/client.js:636-912"]}
{"unit_id":"GooodWei__context-vista#card-en","repo":"GooodWei/context-vista","commit":"c57a4954639c63ccac2744d6c66ec2a67dd5b892","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"context-vista tracks DSH context usage and estimated costs. It adds a /context command and a live, draggable HUD with a usage donut, session totals, per-model estimates, and subagent costs. The HUD can trigger compaction or archive billing. No extra account or API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:898-1020","lib/client.js:636-912"]}
